        <h2>Cart recovery workflow test</h2>
        <p>$163 cart: email 101m / 39h / SMS 6h. $485 cart: adjust discount cap down 11% max. Exit on purchase; suppress OOS.</p>
        <h2>Channel escalation</h2>
        <p>Email carries proof; SMS compresses urgency; never duplicate paragraphs cross-channel. Cap 3 touches per cart per 7 days.</p>
        <h2>Attribution</h2>
        <p>Propose a randomized 5% holdout, subject to adequate sample size and a predefined observation window. Compare incremental orders and contribution after discounts and variable costs across treatment and holdout; platform-attributed recovery alone does not establish causal lift. Check assignment persistence and cross-channel contamination before interpreting the result.</p>
